  "verdict": "revise",
  "issues": [
    "Scope: The contract asks for the raw difference in response proportions between treatment and control after deduplication. The answer reports an adjusted, severity‑weighted difference (0.1501) instead of the estimand.",
    "Grounding: The specific stratum‑specific response rates, severity weights, and the weighted effect (0.1501) are not shown in the printed output provided, so the quantitative claims are not directly supported by the displayed results.",
    "Overreach: The answer presents the adjusted difference as a \"treatment effect\" implying causality, even though treatment assignment was not randomised and residual confounding may remain."
